concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-1994-sec-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 Section 12"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "Section 20 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting subsection (2A) and substituting the following subsection: \"(2A) A person is not to be imprisoned for a failure, under an order made under subsection (1), to pay an amount by way of reparation, restitution or compensation or an amount in respect of costs.... Failure to comply with condition of discharge or release" ;
    skos:definition "Section 20 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting subsection (2A) and substituting the following subsection: \"(2A) A person is not to be imprisoned for a failure, under an order made under subsection (1), to pay an amount by way of reparation, restitution or compensation or an amount in respect of costs.... Failure to comply with condition of discharge or release"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c36a8b14654cd83a73c7007f3f92c3297515c51ec548459da7e4d8992450d330" ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No imprisonment for failure to pay reparation, restitution or compensation" ;
