    values:originalText "No. 113, 1979, as amended. For previous amendments, see No. 182, 1979; No. 65, 1985; No. 122, 1986 (as amended by No. 137, 1988, and No. 115, 1990); No. 89, 1987 (as amended by No. 20, 1987) and No. 141, 1987; Nos. 121, 126 (as amended by No. 63, 1989) and 137, 1988; Nos. 63, 157 and 159, 1989; Nos. 11, 75, and 115, 1990; Nos. 122, 136 and 139, 1991; and No. 64, 1994." ;
