    values:originalText "No. 12, 1914, as amended. For previous amendments, see No. 6, 1915 (as amended by No. 54, 1920); No. 54, 1920; No. 9, 1926; No. 13, 1928; No. 30, 1932; No. 5, 1937; No. 6, 1941; No. 77, 1946; No. 80, 1950; No. 10, 1955; No. 11, 1959; No. 84, 1960; No. 93, 1966; Nos. 33 and 216, 1973; No. 56, 1975; No. 37, 1976; Nos. 19 and 155, 1979; No. 70, 1980; No. 122, 1981 (as amended by No. 193, 1985); Nos. 67 (as amended by No. 193, 1985), 80 and 153, 1982; Nos. 91, 114 and 136, 1983; Nos. 10, 63 and 165, 1984; No. 193, 1985; Nos. 76, 102 and 168, 1986; Nos. 73, 120 and 141, 1987; Nos. 63 and 108, 1989; Nos. 4, 11 and 75, 1990; Nos. 28, 59, 99 (as amended by No. 145, 1991), 120, 123, 140 and 145, 1991; No. 164,1992; No. 98, 1993; and Nos. 65 and 105, 1994." ;
